\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n# Your hands are crowbars, ready to start climbing \n{970292062290314}\nFace hooks, planks, and gears using only your arms!\n\n\n#  Have a Blast with Friends in Multi-Mode \n{1499276821669648}\nIt\u2019s hilarious when friends fall down from above!\n\n\n#  Conquer Chaotic Stages \n{898604883250868}\nWe\u2019ve prepared plenty of stages packed with various gimmicks!\n\n\n#  Dress Up in a Variety of Charming Skins \n{1336357285129321}\nCustomize your character to your heart's content!\n\n\n#  Join the Discord!!\n{935059665974508}\nCheck our Discord for the latest news, player interactions, free skin giveaways, and more!\n\nhttps://mydearest.net/CrowbarClimber-BazookaDiscord", "short_description": "This game is a challenge for all VR gamers who love physics and brain teasers. For VR gamers who are strong in both mind and arm... see you at the top!\n\n\ud83d\udcaaYour hands are crowbars, ready to start climbing \ud83d\udcaa\nIn Crowbar Climber, use your crowbars to make your way up!\nFace hooks, planks, and gears using only your arms. Can you beat the game before you run out of energy?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero_Cover.png", "id": "3345757368930318", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_3345757375596984_2009734447138193048_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dFXsdZLP2egQ7kNvwE_gaYH&_nc_oc=Adou5LY4voX4Pg4FfAhQSOkVUWsnBKHcVZKz095LjDvu0vUZtk8RmLqANQmFilNxpV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9CwEQ0wthu3t8t25JT_-_vCNuszXITiyGmGdm3nZcMgw&oe=6A315A99"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "2380985989062050", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619677_2380985992395383_6